 ------------------
 
 - Fixed a code import bug that slipped in to 3.4. (`#226 <https://github.com/simonw/sqlite-utils/issues/226>`__)
+- ``sqlite-utils insert --csv`` and ``--tsv`` now support ``--no-headers``
+  for files without a header row.
 
